  "thought": "The `json/zip_code.json` file contains a `records` array with `zip_code` and `state` information. I need to join `member.csv` with this JSON data. I will use `read_json_auto` and `UNNEST` to access the nested `records` array in the JSON file. Then I will join on `zip` from `member.csv` and `zip_code` from the unnested JSON data. Finally, I will filter for `short_state = 'IL'` and concatenate `first_name` and `last_name` to get the full name.",
